  {
    "hotel_id": "289127",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/the-z-hotel-soho/hotel/london-gb.html",
    "name": "The Z Hotel Soho",
    "detail": "The staff were very welcoming and sympathetic even though I came to check in very late (due to unforeseen circumstances). They were knowledgeable and more than happy to tell me about the hotels’ facilities and the local area if I wished. My room was generous in size, especially for a London hotel and I was pleased to find everything I needed and more I had not thought to pack. It was a home away from home but with a far better view. The bed was soft, the pillows even better and the soundproofing worked a treat. My four hours sleep felt like twice that much. Breakfast was a leisurely affair with many favourites such as Greek yogurt with toppings, smoked salmon and a large range of pattiserie items to name a few. No detail was too small, down to the fresh orange juice! Overall the best stay in a hotel I’ve had in many years and I WILL be coming back again and soon. ",
